    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">[[/attack extended activity=RkmvpUI0spboBnYE]]. [[/damage average extended activity=RkmvpUI0spboBnYE]], or [[/damage average activity=Mgyp5Wa3cgoXX3N4]] damage if [[lookup @activation.condition activity=Mgyp5Wa3cgoXX3N4]]. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature in the swarm’s space, the target has the &amp;Reference[Grappled apply=false] condition (escape DC [[lookup @skills.acr.passive]]). Until the grapple ends, the target takes [[/damage average activity=n1k1Xq0kdB79VrOI]] damage at the end of each of its turns.</p>",
